{
	"$description": "Hand-authored neumorphic bevel stacks. Seven depth levels from off → deep, each composed of 1–7 DTCG shadow layers that alternate luminance-edge highlights against black shadow wells. `$extensions.com.devpulse.coldlight.svgFilter` carries the SVG feSpecularLighting parameters for the SVG-backed variant.",
